WEBVTT

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:06.367
Two start wires activate wood and stone tasks in parallel

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:12.600
ALL waits for both, ANY for one, COUNT for at least N arrivals

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.633
ALL: finishing wood alone does not unlock the next stage

00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:24.067
After both routes complete, the certificate stage activates

00:00:24.067 --> 00:00:28.133
ANY: wood alone advances the flow and skips the other route
